<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive">
<title>For My Chellam ♡</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');
:root{--ink:#3d2930;--rose:#b86b7c;--cream:#fff8f4;--paper:#fffdfb;--line:#ead9d5;--muted:#806c72}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8f4,#f8eceb 55%,#fffaf7);color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}
body.locked{overflow:hidden}.gate{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,#fff 0,#f7e7e5 45%,#ead2d2 100%)}
.gatebox{width:min(430px,100%);background:rgba(255,253,251,.93);border:1px solid #ead9d5;border-radius:30px;padding:42px 28px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(92,50,60,.15)}
.heart{font-size:42px}h1,h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif}.gate h1{font-size:48px;margin:8px 0}.gate p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
input,textarea{font:inherit}.gate input{width:100%;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fff;margin:14px 0;outline:none;text-align:center}
button{border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;background:var(--ink);color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.error{height:22px;color:#a34f61;font-size:13px}
#site{display:none}.hero{min-height:92vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:70px 20px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;background:#efd6d7;filter:blur(8px);opacity:.55;top:-220px;left:-180px}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;background:#f3e2d5;filter:blur(10px);opacity:.65;bottom:-210px;right:-130px}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:820px}.eyebrow{letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;color:var(--rose);font-weight:600}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,11vw,110px);line-height:.85;margin:20px 0 18px}.hero h1 span{display:block;font-size:.58em;color:var(--rose);font-style:italic}
.hero p{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.35;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 30px}
.hero-photo{width:min(340px,75vw);aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50% 50% 46% 46%;border:10px solid rgba(255,255,255,.75);box-shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(92,50,60,.2);margin:25px auto 0}
section{padding:88px 20px}.wrap{max-width:1050px;margin:auto}.section-title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:42px}.section-title .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:8px}h2{font-size:52px;margin:0 0 10px}.sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:620px;margin:auto;line-height:1.7;text-align:center}
.date-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:35px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 16px 50px rgba(92,50,60,.08)}
.date-card .date{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:72px;color:var(--rose);font-weight:700;line-height:1}.date-card h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:32px;margin:12px 0}.date-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px}.memory{margin:0;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(92,50,60,.07)}.memory:nth-child(3){grid-column:span 2}.memory img{width:100%;height:360px;object-fit:cover;display:block}.memory:nth-child(3) img{height:520px}.memory figcaption{padding:16px 18px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:22px}
.timeline{display:grid;gap:18px;max-width:760px;margin:auto}.tl{padding:22px 24px;border-left:3px solid #d9a5ae;background:rgba(255,253,251,.72);border-radius:0 18px 18px 0}.tl strong{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:25px}.tl p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:0}
.questions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}.qcard{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:23px;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(92,50,60,.05)}.qnum{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--rose);font-weight:700}.qcard p{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;margin:10px 0 18px}textarea{width:100%;min-height:95px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px;background:#fffaf8;resize:vertical;outline:none}
.letter{max-width:780px;margin:auto;background:#fffdfb;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;padding:44px 38px;box-shadow:0 15px 55px rgba(92,50,60,.08);font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:25px;line-height:1.55}.letter .sign{text-align:right;color:var(--rose);margin-top:28px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:65px 20px 90px;color:var(--muted)}footer .big{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond';font-size:38px;color:var(--ink)}
@media(max-width:700px){section{padding:65px 16px}h2{font-size:42px}.gallery,.questions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.memory:nth-child(3){grid-column:auto}.memory img,.memory:nth-child(3) img{height:360px}.date-card .date{font-size:58px}.letter{padding:30px 22px;font-size:22px}}
</style>
</head>
<body class="locked">
<div class="gate" id="gate"><div class="gatebox">
<div class="heart">♡</div><div class="eyebrow">A little surprise</div><h1>For My Chellam</h1>
<p>There is a tiny door to our memories.<br>Only someone who knows our special date should enter.</p>
<input id="pass" type="password" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Our special date" aria-label="Password">
<button onclick="unlock()">Open our story ♡</button><div class="error" id="err"></div><small style="color:#9b878c">Hint: 24 April</small>
</div></div>

<main id="site">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner">
<div class="eyebrow">A little corner of our story</div><h1>Kishore <span>my Chellam</span></h1>
<p>Some memories become photographs. Some become feelings. Ours became a story.</p>
<img class="hero-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our favorite memory">
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">The date that means everything</span><h2>April 24</h2></div>
<div class="date-card"><div class="date">24.04</div><h3>Two reasons. One special date.</h3>
<p>Kishore's birthday 🎂<br>And the day our story began ❤️</p></div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">Little pieces of us</span><h2>Our Memories</h2>
<p class="sub">A few moments I wanted to keep somewhere special — because every picture carries a little piece of our story.</p></div>
<div class="gallery"><figure class="memory"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our memory 1" loading="lazy"><figcaption>One of those smiles I want to remember forever.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="memory"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our memory 2" loading="lazy"><figcaption>A little moment, a big memory.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="memory"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our memory 3" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Hand in hand, heart to heart.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="memory"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our memory 4" loading="lazy"><figcaption>A day worth keeping in our story.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="memory"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our memory 5" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Two people, one beautiful memory.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="memory"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Our memory 6" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Some moments say everything without words.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">Our little timeline</span><h2>Moments I Keep</h2></div>
<div class="timeline">
<div class="tl"><strong>Before it became a story</strong><p>Two people, ordinary days, and moments that slowly became something special.</p></div>
<div class="tl"><strong>April 24 ❤️</strong><p>The day we started writing our own little chapter — and also the day you were born.</p></div>
<div class="tl"><strong>Then came the memories</strong><p>Photos, smiles, silly moments, quiet moments, and all the little things that made “us”.</p></div>
<div class="tl"><strong>And this is not the last page</strong><p>There are still so many memories waiting to be made.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">Only you can answer these</span><h2>Kishore's Memory Challenge</h2>
<p class="sub">Take your time. These aren't about getting everything right — they're about remembering the little things.</p></div>
<div class="questions"><div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">01</div><p>Namma first time pesina moment unakku nyabagam irukka?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">02</div><p>Namma first photo-la irundha moment enna?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">03</div><p>Namma rendu perum serndhu romba happy-aa irundha oru memory edhu?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">04</div><p>Enakku romba pidicha oru small thing unakku nyabagam irukka?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">05</div><p>Namma rendu perukkum mattum special-a irukkura place, song illa word edhu?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">06</div><p>Namma serndhu siricha funniest moment edhu?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">07</div><p>Namma story-la nee marakka mudiyadha moment edhu?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">08</div><p>April 24 unakku enna special?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">09</div><p>Future-la namma create panna vendiya oru beautiful memory enna?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div>
<div class="qcard"><div class="qnum">010</div><p>Namma memories-la unakku most precious-aa irukkura memory edhu?</p><textarea placeholder="Your answer..."></textarea></div></div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">One last thing</span><h2>A Little Letter</h2></div>
<div class="letter">Kishore, my Chellam ❤️<br><br>
I made this little place because some memories deserve more than just sitting in a phone gallery.
Every photo here reminds me of a moment, a smile, a place, or simply the feeling of being together.
<br><br>And among all the dates in the calendar, April 24 will always have a little extra meaning —
it is the day you came into this world, and the day our story began.
<br><br>So here is our tiny corner of memories. Keep it safe, keep smiling, and whenever you come back here,
I hope it takes you back to all these little moments. ✨
<div class="sign">— From someone who treasures our memories ♡</div></div></div></section>

<footer><div class="big">For My Chellam ♡</div><p>Made with memories, smiles & a little bit of love.</p></footer>
</main>

<script>
function unlock(){
 const v=document.getElementById('pass').value.trim();
 if(v==='2404'||v==='24/04'||v==='24.04'){
   document.getElementById('gate').style.display='none';
   document.body.classList.remove('locked');
   document.getElementById('site').style.display='block';
   window.scrollTo(0,0);
 }else{document.getElementById('err').textContent='Not quite… try the special date ♡';}
}
document.getElementById('pass').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')unlock();});
</script>
</body></html>